<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>My Personal Website</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --card-bg: #1e293b;
      --accent: #38bdf8;
      --text: #f8fafc;
      --muted: #94a3b8;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 1rem;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    header p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .card {
      background-color: var(--card-bg);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
    }

    .card h2 {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 4rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>Alex Developer</h1>
      <p>Building clean, fast, and accessible web experiences.</p>
    </header>

    <main class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h2>Web Development</h2>
        <p>Creating responsive layouts and interactive web applications using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h2>UI/UX Design</h2>
        <p>Designing modern, intuitive user interfaces focused on accessibility and user experience.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h2>Open Source</h2>
        <p>Contributing to tools, documentation, and open projects across the developer community.</p>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>&copy; 2026 Alex Developer. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
